<ReportLayout title="Licensing" description="Licensing status for Open Smart Desk research and designs."><section class="report-container py-16 md:py-24"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-text">Project policy</p><h1 class="text-4xl text-ink sm:text-5xl">Licensing</h1><div class="prose prose-site mt-10 max-w-[75ch] prose-headings:font-display prose-p:leading-8"><p>The project is intended to remain open and inspectable. The exact split between software, firmware, hardware design files and future physical products is still an explicit decision, not a claim of a finished commercial offer.</p><p>Until each artefact has its own licence notice, treat the repository's existing notices as authoritative and do not infer distribution rights from this status page.</p></div></section></ReportLayout>
